{"title":"Vampire’s ∞ pathoS","artist":"히토시즈쿠x야마","sourceId":"reference:Y3QerKuLx4XEBWvVxqMD","sourceHash":"43ffd32d3eae551488cd2e2e283419e234407f22845e9c469801255ffd591430","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":9527715,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":24.13,"end":31.36,"text":"満月 危険な本能が暴かれ出す闇の舞台","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":31.36,"end":35.88,"text":"今宵また 摩天楼を震わせて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":35.88,"end":39.05,"text":"とんだ悲劇が起こる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":39.05,"end":42.57,"text":"古今東西 いつぞの世も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":42.57,"end":46.31,"text":"闇夜の演目は 怪物の時間","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":46.31,"end":51.47,"text":"愚かなる子羊の 軽率なフラグにつられ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":51.47,"end":53.74,"text":"幕も開けずに始まる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":53.74,"end":57.11,"text":"臆病羊 科学というフィルムを垂れ流して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":57.11,"end":60.67,"text":"神を殺し 得意顔で｢新世界｣を気取っても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":60.67,"end":64.55,"text":"所詮、これはノンフィクション","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":64.55,"end":67.78,"text":"非科学の前では 憐れに十の文字を切る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":81.42,"end":87.6,"text":"伝承 それはとうに忘れられたパトスと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":87.6,"end":90.85,"text":"思うなら 今宵こそ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":90.85,"end":96.42,"text":"ど田舎を賑わせる あの怪物を捕まえろ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":96.42,"end":99.97999999999999,"text":"古今東西 いつぞの世も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":99.97999999999999,"end":103.61,"text":"闇夜の悲劇は子羊たちの夢想？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":103.61,"end":108.96000000000001,"text":"愚かなる子羊には 解明できない｢ナニカ｣が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":108.96000000000001,"end":110.99000000000001,"text":"今も、背後で嗤っているぜ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":110.99000000000001,"end":114.6,"text":"勘違い羊 科学という棒切れを振り回して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":114.6,"end":118.17,"text":"神を貶し 得意顔で｢新時代｣を謳っても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":118.17,"end":120.21,"text":"所詮、これはノンフィクション","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":120.21,"end":125.64,"text":"真の狂気の前では 憐れに十の文字を切る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":125.64,"end":129.02,"text":"二重螺旋の外で 怪物はパーティーナイト","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":129.02,"end":134.47,"text":"今宵も奴らは ご馳走を狙っているのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":146.62,"end":149.99,"text":"古今東西 いつぞの世も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":149.99,"end":153.7,"text":"正義の影には 悪が蔓延る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":153.7,"end":159.25,"text":"聡明な主役は 緻密なフラグの先で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":159.25,"end":162.05,"text":"グランドフィナーレを迎えにいこう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":162.05,"end":165.65,"text":"臆病羊 科学というフィルムに取り憑かれて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":165.65,"end":169.15,"text":"神を忘れ いつの間にか迷宮に迷い込んだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":169.15,"end":171.07999999999998,"text":"なんと純粋で 愛らしいほどに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":171.07999999999998,"end":172.62,"text":"お馬鹿な子羊)たちを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":172.62,"end":176.43,"text":"無慈悲な悪役が襲う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":176.43,"end":180.03,"text":"勘違い羊 科学というフィルム剥がれ 阿鼻叫喚","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":180.03,"end":183.58,"text":"神を探し 泣き喚いて十字に縋り付けば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":183.58,"end":187.13,"text":"さて、今宵の怪物劇ヴァンパイアの末路は？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":187.13,"end":190.51,"text":"さあ、神よ 導き給え","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":190.51,"end":194.33,"text":"チートな悪役 暴力という合理を振り回して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":194.33,"end":197.84,"text":"悪を気取り 得意顔でアンチテーゼを語っても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":197.84,"end":199.48,"text":"所詮、悪役も ノンフィクション","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":199.48,"end":204.47,"text":"真の強者の前では 憐れに屠られ 消えて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":204.47,"end":208.15,"text":"嗚呼、すべては神のみぞ知る Amen...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}